{
  "key": 43826,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCityPokecenter1F_Text_HaveYouCheckedGlobalTerminal",
      "en_US": [
        "Have you checked out the Global\n",
        "Terminal in Jubilife City?\r",
        "It uses Nintendo Wi-Fi Connection!\n",
        "I can’t explain it, but it’s wicked!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCityPokecenter1F_Text_DoYouHaveAPoffinCase",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello, do you have a Poffin Case?\r",
        "If you haven’t got one, you really\n",
        "must visit the Pokémon Fan Club."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCityPokecenter1F_Text_FeedYourPokemonPoffinsToEnterContests",
      "en_US": [
        "If you feed your Pokémon Poffins\n",
        "routinely, you’ll be able to enter\f",
        "Contests whenever you like."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCityPokecenter1F_Text_FantinaLikesContestsToo",
      "en_US": [
        "Fantina, the Gym Leader, likes\n",
        "Contests, too.\r",
        "That lady has a huge appetite for\n",
        "experiencing everything in life!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCityPokecenter1F_Text_FantinaLikesContestsToo2",
      "en_US": [
        "Fantina, the Gym Leader, likes\n",
        "Contests, too.\r",
        "That lady has a huge appetite for\n",
        "experiencing everything in life!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCityPokecenter1F_Text_KinseyIntro_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "We’re doing a news piece on Trainers.\n",
        "Can we get you to participate?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCityPokecenter1F_Text_KinseyBattleAccepted_Unused",
      "en_US": "Reporter Kinsey’s live interview!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCityPokecenter1F_Text_KinseyBattleDeclined_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "...Are you one of those contrary\n",
        "people who reply “No” first thing?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCityPokecenter1F_Text_KinseyPostBattle_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "Why Trainers choose certain kinds of\n",
        "Pokémon and their feelings about it...\r",
        "That’s what we’re investigating."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCityPokecenter1F_Text_TevinIntro_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "I felt a flash of inspiration when I laid\n",
        "eyes on you.\r",
        "I’d really love to capture you on\n",
        "camera while you’re battling."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCityPokecenter1F_Text_TevinBattleAccepted_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "For close-ups, I need to get in tight.\n",
        "You don’t mind, do you?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCityPokecenter1F_Text_TevinBattleDEclined_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "That’s a downer...\r",
        "I thought I’d found a Trainer and\n",
        "Pokémon who’d shine on camera."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCityPokecenter1F_Text_TevinPostBattle_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "So, did you come to Hearthome to\n",
        "compete in Contests?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello there! I’m Margot from Jubilife\n",
        "TV, the Fun-and-Games TV Station!\r",
        "We’re taking our quiz show all over\n",
        "Sinnoh. Answer five questions right,\r",
        "and you’ll win a fantastic prize!\r",
        "Today’s theme is the Kalos\n",
        "region. Do you want to have a go?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerNotYet",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello there! I’m\n",
        "Margot from Jubilife TV.\r",
        "Our quiz is for Trainers\n",
        "who’ve earned the Relic Badge.\r",
        "Come back once you have it,\n",
        "and we’ll roll the cameras!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerDeclined",
      "en_US": [
        "Aww... Well, we’ll be right\n",
        "here if you change your mind!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerRollCamera",
      "en_US": [
        "Wonderful! Roll camera!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerLetsFind",
      "en_US": [
        "Let’s find out if you’re right!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerWrong",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh no, I’m sorry... That’s\n",
        "not the right answer.\r",
        "You’re welcome to try again anytime!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerWon",
      "en_US": [
        "We have a winner! Congratulations!\r",
        "Your grand prize is the three\n",
        "Pokémon I just battled you with!\r",
        "The first partners of the Kalos\n",
        "region: Chespin, Fennekin and Froakie!\r",
        "Talk to me when you’re\n",
        "ready to take them."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerNoRoom",
      "en_US": [
        "I’d love to hand over your prize, but\n",
        "your party needs room for all three!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerPrizeIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Here they are! The\n",
        "prizes for our winner!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerBye",
      "en_US": [
        "Thanks for playing! Keep\n",
        "watching Jubilife TV!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerCameraman",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m just the cameraman. Don’t mind me!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerName1",
      "en_US": [
        "First, the Spiny Nut\n",
        "Pokémon. It’s CHESPIN!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerReceived1",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received a CHESPIN!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerNickname1",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you want to give a nickname to\n",
        "this CHESPIN?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerName2",
      "en_US": [
        "Next, the Fox Pokémon. It’s FENNEKIN!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerReceived2",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received a FENNEKIN!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerNickname2",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you want to give a nickname to\n",
        "this FENNEKIN?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerName3",
      "en_US": [
        "Last, the Bubble Frog\n",
        "Pokémon. It’s FROAKIE!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerReceived3",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received a FROAKIE!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerNickname3",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you want to give a nickname to\n",
        "this FROAKIE?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerQuestion1",
      "en_US": [
        "Here we go! Question one!\r",
        "Is Lumiose City at the\n",
        "heart of the Kalos region?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerQuestion2",
      "en_US": [
        "Correct! Question two!\r",
        "Does Professor Sycamore\n",
        "study Mega Evolution?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerQuestion3",
      "en_US": [
        "Right again! Question three!\r",
        "Is Valerie, the Laverre City Gym\n",
        "Leader, an expert on Steel types?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerQuestion4",
      "en_US": [
        "Brilliant! Question four!\r",
        "Does Prism Tower\n",
        "stand in Shalour City?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerQuestion5",
      "en_US": [
        "Amazing! Here’s the final question!\r",
        "Can you beat me in a Pokémon battle?"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
